          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "在 20 分钟、平均坡度 4.4% 的爬坡段中，平均功率 207W，踏频 66rpm，速度 18.7 km/h，功率与踏频配合较为协调。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": [
            "claim:upload-965aa12e-01a1-4aaf-84bc-66395c9e92eb:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-24698-31062.power.mean",
            "claim:upload-965aa12e-01a1-4aaf-84bc-66395c9e92eb:v2:segment.climb.event-climb-24698-31062.cadence.mean",
